python-mcp-email-server (1.1.1-1) unstable; urgency=medium

  * Fix: SMTP failures in the connect/authenticate phase (e.g. rejected
    credentials) now report a bounded outcome detail such as
    smtp-authenticate-rejected instead of an opaque provider_failure,
    so a caller can see why send_email failed without server log access.
  * Rename the deb package and launcher binary to mcp-server-email, and
    add an mcprack-mcp-server-email companion package that registers the
    server into the local mcprack catalog.

 -- Vítězslav Dvořák <info@vitexsoftware.cz>  Mon, 14 Sep 2026 22:18:19 +0200

